  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "S’mores & Stars! Free Seasonal Bonfires Included with your booking! Join us for complimentary fires: June 1–Aug 7, Sept 18–Oct 16, and Holiday weeks November & Dec. <br>Welcome to 30A Sunset Palazzo, a stunning luxury vacation rental located in the sought-after 30A community of Blue Mountain Beach, proudly hosted by Bonheur Vacations. From the moment you enter, this beautifully designed home makes a lasting impression with soaring ceilings, abundant natural light, and a wall of glass doors that seamlessly connect the indoor living space to the private outdoor oasis.<br><br>The open-concept living, dining, and kitchen areas are ideal for entertaining and relaxing together. The chef’s kitchen is exceptionally well-equipped with an 8-burner gas range, double ovens, two refrigerators, dual dishwashers, and both drip and pod coffee makers. Seating includes a kitchen island for six, a dining table for eight, and an additional bar-top seating area for three.<br><br>This home comfortably sleeps up to 20 guests and offers six bedrooms, six full ensuite bathrooms, and one half bath, making it an excellent choice for multi-family vacations, corporate retreats, reunions, and boating enthusiasts looking to explore the Choctawhatchee Bay or the Gulf of Mexico.<br><br>Step outside to your private backyard retreat featuring a heated pool and spa (heating available upon request), outdoor fireplace, TV, lounge seating, and a fully equipped outdoor kitchen with grill, refrigerator, and ice maker—perfect for enjoying Florida evenings year-round.<br><br>ABOUT THE AREA<br>Blue Mountain Beach is one of the most charming and peaceful communities along Scenic Highway 30A, nestled between Gulf Place and Grayton Beach. Known for its relaxed, family-friendly atmosphere, the area still offers easy access to local restaurants, boutique shopping, biking paths, and some of the most beautiful beaches on the Emerald Coast.<br><br>BEACH ACCESS<br>The nearest beach access is Gulfview Heights, located approximately 1,800 feet from the home. This access features parking, restrooms, outdoor showers, shaded picnic tables, and seasonal lifeguards.<br>Directions: From the home, turn right onto 30A, then left at Gulfview Heights Street by Goatfeathers Seafood. Continue approximately ¼ mile to the Gulf.<br><br>ACCOMMODATIONS<br><br>First Floor<br>• Bedroom 1: King bed, ensuite bathroom<br>• Bedroom 2: King bed, ensuite bathroom<br><br>Second Floor<br>• Bedroom 3: King bed, ensuite bathroom<br>• Bedroom 4: King bed, ensuite bathroom<br>• Bedroom 5: Bunk room with three Twin/Twin bunks, ensuite bathroom<br>• Bedroom 6: Two Queen beds plus Twin/Twin bunk area, ensuite bathroom<br><br>PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS<br>• Private heated pool and spa (heating available upon request)<br>• Outdoor entertainment area with TV, fireplace, dining table, and lounge seating<br>• Fully equipped outdoor kitchen with grill, refrigerator, and ice maker<br>• Large chef’s kitchen with two refrigerators and two dishwashers<br>• Smart TVs throughout the home<br>• Home office workstation<br>• Full-size washer and dryer on both floors<br>• Upstairs beverage center with mini refrigerator and microwave<br>• Four bicycles included<br>• Fully stocked kitchen<br>• Full linen package (bedding and bath towels)<br>• Starter supply kit (toilet paper, paper towels, dishwasher and laundry pods)<br><br>LOCAL ATTRACTIONS<br>The Big Chill 30A • Gulf Place Plaza • Grayton Beach State Park • Seaside • WaterColor • Alys Beach • Camp Helen State Park • Henderson Beach State Park • Village of Baytowne Wharf",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Luxury Blue Mountain Beach Retreat with Private Pool, Spa & Chef’s Kitchen"
        }
      ],
